description.af_ZA = OpenGFX basis grafik stel vir OpenTTD. Vrylik beskikbaar onder die terms van die GNU General Public License weergawe 2. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.ar_EG = OpenGFX مجموعة الرسوميات الاساسية لـOpenTTD. متاحة مجانا تحت نظام النسخة الثانية من الرخص الشعبية العامة GNU . للاطلاع اكثر http://wiki.openttd.org/OpenGFX_Readme. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.be_BY = OpenGFX уяўляе сабою базавы набор графікі для OpenTTD. Вольна распаўсюджваецца ў адпаведнасці з ліцэнзіяй GNU General Public License version 2. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.pt_BR = Conjunto de gráficos base OpenGFX para OpenTTD. Disponível gratuitamente dentro dos termos da GNU General Public License versão 2. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.bg_BG = OpenGFX графичен пакет за OpenTTD. Свободен за разпространение по условията на GNU General Public License версия 2. Повече информация на http://wiki.openttd.org/OpenGFX_Readme (англ). [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.ca_ES = Joc de gràfics base OpenGFX per a l'OpenTTD. Disponible lliurement sota els termes de la GNU General Public License versió 2. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.hr_HR = OpenGFX osnovni grafički paket za OpenTTD. Dostupan besplatno pod uvjetima GNU General Public License verzija 2. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.cs_CZ = Základní sada grafik pro OpenTTD. Volně dostupné pod licencí GNU General Public License verze 2. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.da_DK = OpenGFX-basegrafiksæt til OpenTTD. Frit tilgængelig under betingelserne i GNU General Public License version 2. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.nl_NL = Basisset grafische elementen OpenGFX voor OpenTTD. Vrij beschikbaar onder de voorwaarden van de GNU General Public License versie 2. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.en_GB = OpenGFX base graphics set for OpenTTD. Freely available under the terms of the GNU General Public License version 2. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.en_AU = OpenGFX base graphics set for OpenTTD. Freely available under the terms of the GNU General Public License version 2. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.en_US = OpenGFX base graphics set for OpenTTD. Freely available under the terms of the GNU General Public License version 2. More information available in the readme at http://wiki.openttd.org/OpenGFX_Readme. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.eo_EO = OpenGFX baza grafikaro por OpenTTD. Libere uzebla laŭ la kondiĉoj de la Ĝenerala Publika Permesilo de GNU (GPL) versio 2. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.et_EE = OpenGFX alusgraafika OpenTTD tarvis. Vabalt saadaval GNU Üldise Avaliku Litsentsi versioon 2 alusel. Lisainfo leiad aadressilt http://wiki.openttd.org/OpenGFX_Readme. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.fi_FI = OpenGFX perusgrafiikat OpenTTD:lle. Vapaasti saatavilla lisenssillä GNU General Public License version 2. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.fr_FR = Graphismes de base OpenGFX pour OpenTTD. Disponibles librement selon les termes de la Licence Publique Générale GNU version 2. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.gd_GB = Seata grafaigeachd OpenGFX bunasach airson OpenTTD. Tha seo ri fhaighinn saor ’s an asgaidh fo theirmichean GNU General Public License tionndadh 2. Gheibh thu barrachd fiosrachaidh san “Leugh mi” air http://wiki.openttd.org/OpenGFX_Readme. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.gl_ES = Conxunto básico de gráficos OpenGFX para OpenTTD. Dispoñíbel de xeito gratuito baixo os termos da Licenza Pública Xeral GNU versión 2. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.de_DE = OpenGFX-Basisgrafikset für OpenTTD. Frei verfügbar unter der GNU General Public License in der Version 2. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.el_GR = Βασικό σετ γραφικών OpenGFX για το OpenTTD. Ελεύθερα διαθέσιμο σύμφωνα με τους όρους της GNU General Public License έκδοση 2. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.he_IL = OpenGFX ערכת גרפיקה בסיסית לOpenTTD.בחינם תחת רשיון GPL2. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.hi_IN = ओपनटीडी के लिए ओपनजीएफएक्स बेस ग्राफिक्स सेट । जीएनयू जनरल पब्लिक लाइसेंस संस्करण 2 की शर्तों के तहत स्वतंत्र रूप से उपलब्ध है । [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.hu_HU = OpenGFX grafikus alapcsomag az OpenTTD-hez. Ingyenesen hozzáférhető a GNU General Public License 2-es verziójának feltételeivel. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.id_ID = Setelan dasar grafik OpenGFX untuk OpenTTD. Tersedia secara bebas di bawah Lisensi Publik Umum GNU versi 2. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.it_IT = Pacchetto grafico di base OpenGFX per OpenTTD. Liberamente disponibile secondo i termini della GNU General Public License versione 2. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.ja_JP = OpenTTD 用のの OpenGFX グラフィック置き換えセット。GNU General Public License version 2 に基づいて自由に利用できます。[OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.ko_KR = OpenTTD용 OpenGFX 기본 그래픽 세트입니다. GNU 일반 공중 라이선스(GPL) 버전 2의 약관에 의거하여 자유롭게 사용할 수 있습니다. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.la_VA = OpenTTD fundamentum graphicum OpenGFX. Gratis parabile est sub licentiam GNU GPL v2. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.lv_LV = OpenGFX bāzes grafikas komplekts OpenTTD. Pieejams bezmaksas, saskaņā ar GNU vispārējās publiskās licences 2. versijas noteikumiem. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.lt_LT = „OpenGFX“ yra bazinis grafikos failų rinkinys, skirtas „OpenTTD“. Laisvai prieinamas pagal „GNU GPL v2“ liceciją. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.lb_LU = OpenGFX Basisgrafikset fir OpenTTD. Gratis ënnert der GNU General Public License Versioun 2. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.nb_NO = OpenGFX grafikksett for OpenTTD. Fritt tilgjengelig under betingelsene i GNU General Public License versjon 2.[OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.nn_NO = OpenGFX grafikksett for OpenTTD. Fritt tilgjengeleg under vilkåra i GNU General Public License versjon 2. Meir informasjon finn du på http://wiki.openttd.org/OpenGFX_Readme. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.fa_IR = ست گرافیکی OpenGFX برای OpenTTD. قابل استفاده به صورت رایگان تحت ضوابط GNU GPL2.  [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.pl_PL = OpenGFX to podstawowy zestaw grafik do OpenTTD. Swobodnie dostępny na warunkach licencji GNU General Public License wersja 2. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.pt_PT = Conjunto de gráficos base OpenGFX para OpenTTD. Disponível livremente dentro dos termos da Licença Pública Geral, GNU versão 2. Mais informação disponível no leia-me em http://wiki.openttd.org/OpenGFX_Readme. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.ro_RO = Set grafic OpenGFX pentru OpenTTD. Disponibil liber sub termenii Licenței Publice Generale GNU, versiunea 2. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.ru_RU = OpenGFX представляет собой базовый набор графики для OpenTTD. Свободно распространяется в соответствии с лицензией GNU General Public License version 2. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.sr_RS = OpenGFX skup osnovnih grafika za OpenTTD. Slobodno dostupan pod uslovima 2. verzije GNU-ove opšte javne licence. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.zh_CN = 供 OpenTTD 使用的 OpenGFX 基本图形集，在 GNU General Public License 第 2 版授权下可免费使用。 [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.sk_SK = OpenGFX, základná sada grafiky pre OpenTTD. Voľne dostupná pod licenciou GNU General Public License version 2. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.sl_SI = Temeljni OpenGFX grafični paket za OpenTTD. Na voljo zastonj pod licenco GNU General Public License verzija 2. Več informacij na voljo na http://wiki.openttd.org/OpenGFX_Readme. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.es_ES = OpenGFX es un conjunto de gráficos base para OpenTTD. Está disponible de forma libre bajo los términos de la Licencia Pública General GNU version 2.[OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.es_MX = Paquete de gráficos base OpenGFX para OpenTTD, disponible de forma libre bajo los términos de la licencia pública general de la GNU, versión 2. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.sv_SE = OpenGFX basgrafikpaket för OpenTTD. Fritt tillgängligt enligt villkoren för GNU General Public License version 2 licensen.[OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.ta_IN = OpenGFX OpenTTD இற்கு அடிப்படை அசைவூட்டத் தொகுப்பாகும். GNU General Public License version 2 உரிமத்தின் கீழ் இலவசமாக கிடைக்கிறது. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.th_TH = OpenGFX เป็นระบบกราฟิกที่สร้างขึ้นมาสำหรับ OpenTTD ที่สามารถใช้ได้ฟรี อยู่ภายใต้ลิขสิทธิ์ GNU General Public License เวอร์ชั่น 2 [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.zh_TW = 供 OpenTTD 使用的 OpenGFX 基礎圖形集，在 GNU General Public License 第 2 版授權下可免費使用。 [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.tr_TR = OpenTTD için OpenGFX temel grafik seti. GNU Genel Kamu Lisansı sürüm 2 maddeleri kapsamında serbestçe edinilebilir. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.uk_UA = OpenGFX -- базова графіка для OpenTTD. Вільно доступна за умовами GNU General Public License version 2. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.vi_VN = Gói đồ họa nền tảng OpenGFX dùng cho OpenTTD. Được phát hành miễn phí dưới giấy phép GNU General Public License phiên bản 2. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description.cy_GB = Set graffeg sylfaen OpenGFX ar gyfer OpenTTD. Ar gael yn rhydd o dan termau'r Trwydded Gyhoeddus Gyffredinol GNU fersiwn 2. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]
description = OpenGFX base graphics set for OpenTTD. Freely available under the terms of the GNU General Public License version 2. [OpenGFX 20260617-master-mc51c904f4f]

